title: About
description: About Jay Bell - CTO of Trellis.org, Angular GDE, Nx Champion, host of The Angular Plus Show.
eleventyNavigation:
    key: About
    order: 6
---

{% from "icons.njk" import typescript, angular, nestjs, express, nx, graphql, ngrx, webstorm, circleci %}

<section class="py-14 pb-[72px]">
    <div class="animate-rise mb-10 flex items-center gap-5">
        <img
            alt="Jay Bell"
            class="h-20 w-20 rounded-full border border-line object-cover"
            src="/assets/images/jay.jpg"
        />
        <div>
            <h1 class="mb-2 font-display text-[clamp(30px,5vw,42px)] tracking-tight text-ink">About Me</h1>
            <p class="max-w-[560px] text-base leading-[1.65] text-ink2">
                Jay Bell - CTO &amp; Co-Founder of Trellis.org, Angular GDE, Nx Champion, Open Source contributor and podcaster.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-jay">
        <p>
            I'm the CTO and Co-Founder of
            <a href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Trellis.org</a>, a social
            enterprise building fundraising software for nonprofits. I've steered Trellis's technical
            direction since we started in 2018. Today the platform runs ticketing, check-in,
            auctions, paddle raises, and donations for hundreds of galas, with more than $150M raised
            for charities and the communities they serve.
        </p>
        <p>
            I'm born and raised in Canada and call Kamloops, B.C. home. I've been shipping software for
            over a decade, and have been chasing entrepreneurial ventures from drones to software and mobile apps on the
            way to co-founding Trellis.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">My favorite stack and tools to build with are:</p>
        <div class="stack-icons mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ typescript('h-4 w-4') }}TypeScript
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ angular('h-4 w-4') }}Angular
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ nestjs('h-4 w-4') }}Nest
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ express('h-4 w-4') }}Express
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ nx('h-4 w-4') }}Nx
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ graphql('h-4 w-4') }}GraphQL
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ ngrx('h-4 w-4') }}NgRx
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ nx('h-4 w-4') }}Nx Cloud/Agents
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ webstorm('h-4 w-4') }}WebStorm
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink2">
                {{ circleci('h-4 w-4') }}CircleCI
            </span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Community is where I spend a lot of my energy. I'm an Angular Google Developer Expert, an Nx
            Champion, and an active open-source maintainer and contributor - you'll find me around the same packages and tools I used in my job and hobby projects.
            I co-host The Angular Plus Show, write the <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/newsletters/trellis-engineering-dispatch-7482227961551593472/" target="_blank">Trellis Engineering Dispatch newsletter</a>, and share
            what we're learning on the
            <a href="https://tech.trellis.org" target="_blank">Trellis Tech Blog</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
            Off the clock, I'm probably building The Animus, a Warhammer 40k companion app that helps players play the Horde game mode for Warhammer 40k, mountain biking, or just coding for fun.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="things">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Things I do</span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-12 mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 border border-line max-sm:grid-cols-1" data-reveal>
        <div class="border-b border-r border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Podcast</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">The Angular Plus Show</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">The home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast. Listen on Spotify.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-line p-5">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Hobby</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">The Animus app</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">Warhammer 40k companion app built with Angular and Nx for playing Horde mode.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-r border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Community</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Angular GDE / Nx Champion</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">Helping grow the Angular and Nx communities through talks and open source.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-line p-5">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Work</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Trellis</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">
                Building software that has to hold up when it matters most.
                <a href="https://tech.trellis.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Read the Trellis Tech Blog →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-line p-5">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Show</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">This is Tech Talks</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">A show about tech, software, and the people building it.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="links">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Find me</span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 mt-2 flex flex-col border-t border-line" data-reveal>
        {% for link in links %}
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[140px_1fr] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-line py-[18px] max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-1">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink3">{{ link.label }}</span>
                <span class="text-[13px] text-ink2">
                    <a href="{{ link.href }}" {% if link.href | isExternal %}target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"{% endif %}>{{ link.text }}</a>
                    {% if link.note %} - {{ link.note }}{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
